1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:52,400
Alright,

25
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:53,830
I'll fight you.

26
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:01,760
As expected of the one who killed Li Yuanfeng and the Giant Demon Clan Ancestor.

27
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:03,850
I look forward to learning from you

28
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,790
In this spar,

29
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:08,150
Brother Ceng doesn't need to hold back due to my status.

30
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:14,350
A celestial artifact !

31
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:18,150
Since Brother Ceng is using his trump cards,

32
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:19,750
then I, Qian Fe...

33
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:21,790
Devour !

34
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:24,950
This guy keeps attacking me

35
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:25,950
and interrupting me !

36
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:28,550
Cheap tricks !

37
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:32,320
Ceng Niu truly embodies the philosophy of our Soul Refining Sect.

38
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:34,270
Either you don't act

39
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:37,390
or you take the initiative.

40
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:40,150
Don't celebrate too soon !

41
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:44,280
Suzaku Awl

42
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,750
The Suzaku Awl...

43
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:47,550
It's Zhuque Zi's pseudo-celestial artifact.

44
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:49,150
It's extremely powerful.

45
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:50,750
Explode !

46
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:54,010
Suzaku Formation,

47
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:54,980
gather !

48
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:05,870
It takes some guts to think of using

49
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:08,320
self-detonation tactics.

50
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:10,790
Fortunately, he's only using the sub-flag

51
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:13,030
so it's not a big deal.

52
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:16,150
Otherwise, I would have been heartbroken.

53
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,150
Thank you, Senior.

54
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:19,950
Junior will find opportunities

55
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:21,990
to replenish the Billion-Soul Flag.

56
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:24,750
Brother Ceng is really skilled,

57
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:27,350
I have learned much from this.

58
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,910
You talk too much.

59
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:30,310
Let's go !

60
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:39,670
Red Butterfly,

61
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,270
come out !

62
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:52,590
He really dared to hurt me ?

63
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:55,590
Your master is getting senile

64
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,550
so your domain will be mine.

65
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,830
Junior Sister's domain

66
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:02,750
will also be mine.

67
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:06,550
Lick it clean.

68
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:11,600
This Billion-Soul Flag is indeed powerful.

69
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:12,870
Unfortunately,

70
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:15,910
it will soon change owners.

71
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:26,240
Focus on cultivation

72
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:28,760
and you will reach Soul Transformation.

73
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:31,070
With this old man guarding you,

74
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:33,550
as long as I live,

75
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:36,390
no one will disturb you.

76
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:37,590
Thank you.

77
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:38,760
Don't thank me,

78
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:41,550
just remember our promise.

79
00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:43,800
Senior can rest assured.

80
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:50,910
Soul Transformation has 3 steps.

81
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:52,310
The first step

82
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:53,950
is to cleanse the body.

83
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:57,150
When the Celestial Realm was intact,

84
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:59,550
cultivators just needed to enter it

85
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:02,150
and soak themselves in the Spirit Cleansing Pool.

86
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:06,550
But now, it requires celestial spiritual energy to cleanse the body

87
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,870
of its mortal roots.

88
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:12,750
Thus transforming the body completely.

89
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:17,750
My mortal roots

90
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:19,470
are gone.

91
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,830
The second step of Soul Transformation

92
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,790
is to refine a celestial body.

93
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:28,950
By using celestial spiritual energy to rebuild flesh and bones,

94
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:32,630
it makes the body compatible with celestial spiritual energy.

95
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:37,230
Although it's excruciatingly painful,

96
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:41,590
it transforms your body into that of a Celestial.

97
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:49,280
3 days later

98
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,670
Good.

99
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:02,630
Now, the final step is

100
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,710
to condense the Origin Soul

101
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:07,350
and make it corporeal.

102
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:09,750
Once the Origin Soul fully condenses,

103
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:12,230
it will merge with the body.

104
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,760
Only then

105
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:15,750
will Soul Transformation be complete.

106
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,790
What is this smell ?

107
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:21,590
The scent of your celestial body

108
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:25,790
will attract beasts and vengeful souls that want to possess it.

109
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,550
Young friend,

110
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:30,470
leave the outside to this old man.

111
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:32,630
No matter what happens,

112
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:34,030
you must stay focused

113
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:36,550
or your Origin Soul will scatter

114
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:38,040
and all will be lost.

115
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,470
Do you understand ?

116
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:40,550
Understood.

117
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:54,500
I must stay focused

118
00:06:54,750 --> 00:06:56,350
and keep it steady.

119
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:06,750
This war caused many deaths

120
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:10,310
and made these vengeful souls stronger.

121
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:54,150
Senior Brother,

122
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:57,430
I will give the Billion-Soul Flag to Ceng Niu.

123
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:00,190
I don't know if it's the right choice.

124
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:02,390
But with this war,

125
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:04,750
our sect may not survive.

126
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,790
No matter where he goes,

127
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:11,590
he will preserve our sect's legacy.

128
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,470
Maybe

129
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:19,350
this is what your domain foretold.

130
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:21,670
Soul Vortex !

131
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,990
In this life,

132
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:27,590
we don't seek immortality,

133
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:30,590
but a worthy way to die.

134
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:35,030
Our Soul Refining Sect Ancestors

135
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:38,150
all willingly erased their Divine Sense to become primary souls.

136
00:08:39,160 --> 00:08:40,390
And I, Du Tian,

137
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:42,830
will not fall behind.

138
00:08:45,880 --> 00:08:48,750
We will reunite soon.

139
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:58,240
West of the
Suzaku Continent

140
00:09:01,160 --> 00:09:04,040
Ancestral Spirit Seed

141
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,550
Fifth Ancestor,

142
00:09:11,800 --> 00:09:13,110
the time has come.
